  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life-saving assistance to children and their families affected by armed conflicts in Eastern DR Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide WASH, Child Protection and Shelter and Non-Food Items assistance to vulnerable communities affected by violence in the Rutshuru Territory of the Democratic Republic of Congo. This UNICEF project provides assistance for 249,500 people to meet their food security needs, including 44,914 women, 37,743 men, 166,843 children, and 37,372 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
